Overwatch — authors and copyright holders

Clément Igonet is the sole author of the original source code in this
repository and the sole holder of its copyright.

The git history contains several author strings. They are all the same
person, and are listed here so that the ownership of the work is
unambiguous:

    Clément Igonet   <contact@confinia.io>
    clement-igonet   <contact@confinia.io>
    clement-igonet   <clement@igonet.fr>

"Confinia" is the GitHub organisation used to host the project. It is
administered by Clément Igonet and holds no separate copyright claim.

Any future contribution by a third party will be recorded here, and will
require a contributor licence agreement assigning or licensing the
contribution to the copyright holder, so that the dual-licensing option
described in NOTICE remains available.
